From the Phase 5 whole-phase review. **Files:** `scenes/OnlineFfaArena.cs`, `scenes/OnlineFfaArena.Combat.cs`, `test/TestFfaMatchFlow.cs`, `test/TestFfaLoadLeave.cs`.

