5. Remove the unused `_famePreview`. Reset the static TEST-ONLY hooks (`TestWithholdMaze`, `TestIgnoreMazeFromSeat`) in the arena's `_ExitTree`, so a scene reload inside one test process starts clean.
6. **Test strengthening:**
